<button data-p="sweep">Sweep 50 Hz–10 kHz</button><button data-p="stop">Stop</button></div>
<p class="note">These play through the sink above, so you hear your settings.</p>
<div class="btns" id="raw" style="margin-top:12px">
<button data-p="ch0">Raw ch0 · L woofer</button><button data-p="ch1">Raw ch1 · R woofer</button>
<button data-p="ch2">Raw ch2 · L tweeter</button><button data-p="ch3">Raw ch3 · R tweeter</button></div>
<p class="note">Raw buttons bypass the tuning and drive one speaker channel directly.</p>
